{"productId": "970080c1-1d9b-4ee1-8b56-223698ef7b4f", "modelName": "MRAD ELR", "modelDescription": "The MRAD ELR is a high quality, military tested, off-the-shelf, extreme long-range system with user changeable barrels and calibers. Designed to deliver precision typically achieved only by custom-built rifles, this rifle expands the bolt-action, magazine-fed MRAD family to include 416 Barrett with additional large-caliber options to be available in the future. Boasting innovative technology, precision engineering, and exceptional materials, the MRADELR is yet another example of Barrett Firearms\u2019 dedication to excellence. Recently crowned the \u201cBallistic Best Editor\u2019s Select\u201d for the Best ELR Rifle, the MRAD ELR has demonstrated excellent precision and accuracy with its remarkable performance at the global King of 2 Miles competition earning a remarkable 2nd place finish as a production rifle competing primarily against custom builds. This rifle is poised to redefine the standards of long-range shooting, combining cutting-edge technology with precision engineering. With Barrett\u2019s proven track record and recognition among the industry\u2019s elite, the new MRAD ELR stands as a symbol of innovation and excellence, offering shooters an unrivaled experience in the world of extreme long-range marksmanship.", "manufacturerName": "Barrett", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "10b58880-105b-45a5-aff1-79e42b43a613", "description": "Barrett, MRAD ELR, Bolt Action Rifle, 416 Barrett, 36\" Barrel, Muzzle Brake, Flat Dark Earth Finish, Adjustable Stock, Right Hand, 5 Round Capacity, Includes Hard Carrying Case", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/1cf8ce65-cfa1-4071-ad1d-e1ab571db2be", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/46890f86-b871-4340-994a-4b47beaae210", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/4b4e1d75-1de9-4a7a-ba73-3c47825f3236", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/